{"ID":"20260901150003-g0klx7j","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260901150003-g0klx7j","title":"实习内容","type":"doc","updated":"20260902164204"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260901150003-gu6iy82","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260901150003-gu6iy82","updated":"20260902121136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"windbg-MCP服务"}]},{"ID":"20260901161220-k74zu8p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260901161220-k74zu8p","updated":"20260902121136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体架构与选型"}]},{"ID":"20260902113937-88916oy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260902113937-88916oy","updated":"20260902121136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI"}]},{"ID":"20260902113947-kd09530","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902113947-kd09530","updated":"20260902114355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI是Python里Web服务器和Web应用之间的异步接口标准。\n它的前辈WSGI是2003年定的同步标准，一个请求进来就调一次你的函数，函数返回完整响应就结束。\n这个模型在当年够用，但是有两个致命短板：一次只能处理一个请求（靠多线程/多进程堆并发）\n天生不支持长连接---websocket、SSE、HTTP流式响应这些都做不了，ASGI就是为了解决这两点而生的。"}]},{"ID":"20260902114812-0lam8ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902114812-0lam8ud","updated":"20260902120814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"ASGI的核心模型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nASGI不再是掉一次函数拿返回值，而是一个可调用对象被调用一次，拿到三个东西"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-q7zrucg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-q7zrucg","updated":"20260902120828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当一个请求过来，服务器调用我们异步应用的时候，会传入三个对象：scope、receive 和 send\nscope 存放本次连接一开始的基础信息，像请求路径、协议类型\nreceive 用来持续接收客户端后续发来的数据\nsend 可以多次向客户端推送响应"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-w94m9r6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-w94m9r6","updated":"20260902120835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最关键的一点就是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一次调用应用，就可以收发多次消息，连接不用马上断开"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n正是依靠这个能力，ASGI 原生支持 WebSocket 双向通信、SSE 推送还有 HTTP 流式响应这类长连接场景"}]},{"ID":"20260902120812-vpum19b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120812-vpum19b","updated":"20260902120909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再加上它基于 async 异步函数运行在事件循环上，遇到 IO 阻塞的时候可以让出资源去处理别的请求\n所以单进程就能实现很高的并发，相比多线程并发，切换开销也要小很多"}]},{"ID":"20260902120911-wko944w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120911-wko944w","updated":"20260902120938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"项目中为什么用"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-h8ddj5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-h8ddj5j","updated":"20260902121056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ASGI 不只支持 HTTP，通过 scope 的 type 字段可以区分 http、websocket、lifespan 三种连接\n其中 lifespan 是应用生命周期钩子，可以在服务启停时做资源初始化与回收工作，WSGI 并不具备这个能力"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-qwkyg7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-qwkyg7c","updated":"20260902121108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Uvicorn 是 ASGI 服务器，负责监听端口、驱动事件循环\nStarlette 是 ASGI 应用框架，提供路由、中间件；ASGI 就是两者之间的接口契约"}]},{"ID":"20260902120937-m2y0w7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902120937-m2y0w7r","updated":"20260902121136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们项目选用 ASGI 是业务场景决定的\n接口需要流式响应、大文件分片上传，还需要生命周期管理常驻进程，这些需求用同步方案很难实现\n同时 ASGI 更适合 IO 密集场景，CPU 或者阻塞任务不能直接跑在协程里，我们会用线程池执行阻塞调用，避免卡住事件循环"}]},{"ID":"20260902101300-uhf7one","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260902101300-uhf7one","updated":"20260902164204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette（ASGI 框架）"}]},{"ID":"20260902101313-njz9z3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902101313-njz9z3q","updated":"20260902125435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Starlette是Python里一个很轻的异步Web框架，跑在ASGI上，只负责三件最基础的事：\n路由分发、中间件、把HTTP请求响应包装成python对象。参数校验、API文档、依赖注入它统统不管。\n而FastAPI就是Starlette加上Pydantic校验和自动生成Swagger文档那一层便利"}]},{"ID":"20260902125437-nhe3zff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125437-nhe3zff","updated":"20260902125504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中这套 REST的形态决定了用不上 FastAPI的核心价值\n每个端点入参就dump_sha1、commands、timeout这几个标量字\n段，全是用isinstance 加手写的_as_list、_json_error做校验\n没有任何复杂嵌套schema—Pydantic的价值在 schema 复杂、要复用、要给前端生成类型定义的时候才明显，我们这种规模用它反而把代码写长了\n自动OpenAPI文档同理，调用方是同一仓库里的JS，没有\"开放 API给人看 swagger\"的需求"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-4yladh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-4yladh5","updated":"20260902125804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目用到了 FastMCP，它里面"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"streamable_http_app()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​返回的，本身就是一个 Starlette 的子应用\n一开始我们过用 Mount 的方式挂载这个子应用，但是踩了一个坑\nStarlette 挂载路由的时候，如果访问"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​不带末尾斜杠，它就会返回 307 重定向，跳转到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/mcp/"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n而 MCP 客户端发送 POST 请求的时候，并不会自动跟随这个重定向，接口直接调用失败"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-cozg0u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-cozg0u6","updated":"20260902125834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们换了方案，直接把子应用里面的路由列表摘出来，手动合并到我们主应用当中，避开重定向问题\n这种直接读取框架内部路由、手动拼装的操作，也正是 Starlette 这种底层轻量框架比较方便做到的\n这个属于硬性要求，和是不是 REST 接口没有关系"}]},{"ID":"20260902125743-gtud4x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902125743-gtud4x6","updated":"20260902125743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外我们整个项目属于重度 IO 场景，包含大文件流式落盘、CDB 子进程管理、MCP 流式收发，整条链路都是异步实现，ASGI 架构刚好完美适配这类业务。"}]},{"ID":"20260902164204-98ckhhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260902164204-98ckhhu","updated":"20260902164204"}},{"ID":"20260901152220-d9rcgk4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260901152220-d9rcgk4","updated":"20260901161221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash反馈工具"}]},{"ID":"20260901161221-xprzq47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901161221-xprzq47","updated":"20260901161221"}},{"ID":"20260901161141-3pf9q26","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260901161141-3pf9q26","updated":"20260901161222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"工具统计后台"}]},{"ID":"20260901161222-yv6mt56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901161222-yv6mt56","updated":"20260901161222"}},{"ID":"20260901161147-0z429jy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260901161147-0z429jy","updated":"20260901161150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"企微项目"}]},{"ID":"20260901160542-ulmeluz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260901160542-ulmeluz","updated":"20260901150101"}},{"ID":"20260901150118-gjat6zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150118-gjat6zk","updated":"20260901150118"}},{"ID":"20260901150101-xdxpm4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150101-xdxpm4b","updated":"20260901150101"}},{"ID":"20260901150101-s7dnj81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150101-s7dnj81","updated":"20260901150101"}},{"ID":"20260901150101-kq2zhar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150101-kq2zhar","updated":"20260901150101"}},{"ID":"20260901150101-63imoey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150101-63imoey","updated":"20260901150101"}},{"ID":"20260901150101-llp71g0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150101-llp71g0","updated":"20260901150101"}},{"ID":"20260901150101-b8s42fh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150101-b8s42fh","updated":"20260901150101"}},{"ID":"20260901150101-rhqgoz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150101-rhqgoz3","updated":"20260901150101"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-4w88cod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-4w88cod","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-iagektg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-iagektg","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-zfzaqqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-zfzaqqz","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-n2x1o9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-n2x1o9l","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-nil0kai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-nil0kai","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-65b631i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-65b631i","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-lxnirrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-lxnirrw","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-n9zo89d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-n9zo89d","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-putzyj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-putzyj8","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-h1rimmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-h1rimmu","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-4xwnuty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-4xwnuty","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-aqoweoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-aqoweoc","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-zvqmtjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-zvqmtjq","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-6xdb7lw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-6xdb7lw","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-dzqgrus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-dzqgrus","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-vl8jet4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-vl8jet4","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-3mqppb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-3mqppb5","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-l1xdb43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-l1xdb43","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-b7f3bzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-b7f3bzn","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-hclsz0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-hclsz0v","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-xg6d5i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-xg6d5i3","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-8v168eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-8v168eo","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-sos0sq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-sos0sq2","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-4l9qybb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-4l9qybb","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-34t16t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-34t16t9","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-c41pdh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-c41pdh4","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-ewke3hx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-ewke3hx","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-c1rioa3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-c1rioa3","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-uv1y0c0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-uv1y0c0","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-qfay4bj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-qfay4bj","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-dmz7lr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-dmz7lr1","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150102-ps63wdd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150102-ps63wdd","updated":"20260901150102"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-7tpu2uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-7tpu2uh","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-udg5y8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-udg5y8c","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-c8yqdcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-c8yqdcy","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-mscg60w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-mscg60w","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-t4dsh89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-t4dsh89","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-05ry3zs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-05ry3zs","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-1no5ilb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-1no5ilb","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-5ciyvjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-5ciyvjq","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-9ki0mb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-9ki0mb2","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-aij02fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-aij02fs","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-4qwjkvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-4qwjkvq","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-nq5phmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-nq5phmn","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-hwdyazt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-hwdyazt","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-06gkjxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-06gkjxf","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-vy5zwmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-vy5zwmz","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-i69ugry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-i69ugry","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-0xmru7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-0xmru7u","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-lkn3frd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-lkn3frd","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-0f3ap00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-0f3ap00","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-kzcgcoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-kzcgcoa","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-daexb6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-daexb6h","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-9qy467x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-9qy467x","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-htf3pd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-htf3pd1","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-gjmyoxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-gjmyoxy","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-wbrxmlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-wbrxmlh","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-y90j8wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-y90j8wq","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-dtq00t7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-dtq00t7","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-3onu9ik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-3onu9ik","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-corzlu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-corzlu0","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-vac4kw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-vac4kw9","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150103-ds0m1uv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150103-ds0m1uv","updated":"20260901150103"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-234k4pi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-234k4pi","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-tpnpjt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-tpnpjt0","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-n0g64ob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-n0g64ob","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-o7brxl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-o7brxl0","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-8a7oj1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-8a7oj1w","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-ypka8gc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-ypka8gc","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-h2dig1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-h2dig1q","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-l4c2r6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-l4c2r6z","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-6kt6gpi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-6kt6gpi","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-v7k3o8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-v7k3o8t","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-kkgk85t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-kkgk85t","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-qrtp903","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-qrtp903","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-6z4jf46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-6z4jf46","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-uykoq1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-uykoq1z","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-pyl4ips","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-pyl4ips","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-jciffil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-jciffil","updated":"20260901150104"}},{"ID":"20260901150104-phizl4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260901150104-phizl4j","updated":"20260901150104"}}]}